{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>由發展局舉辦的「古蹟周遊樂」本月展開，以「穿越北都」為主題，介紹區內多處法定古蹟和歷史建築。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.NING.BLOG-1200_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026EAV3Ek3xzO1792321786.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>涵蓋北都12處宗祠、家塾、書室、學校及舊警署等多座具代表性建築，其中法定古蹟廖萬石堂建於清朝雍正初年，原是上水鄉廖族的祖祠，1932年開辦作鳳溪小學，培育鄉中子弟。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.NING.BLOG-1200_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026XTSLaV913n1792321771.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>發展局局長甯漢豪在網誌表示，今年「古蹟周遊樂」10至12月舉行，今年亦首次將導賞與開篷巴士結合，設計了3條主題路線。</p><p></p><p>期間亦會推出超過170個免費導賞團、工作坊和專題講座等，藉此向市民及旅客推廣文物建築保育。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T11:39:21.594585+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":234,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T10:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T17:57:46.091074+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T11:38:00.909865+00:00","content_hash":"6377ab4b1ba3109290641ffa769331a512b7d037467a8566d3202417443b7e2d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}